    "body": "## Intake review\n\n**Related:** sibling queue-seam filings #7325 (poll cannot read the queues — the same table-vs-JSON mismatch from the poll side) and #7355 (chunked list response silently empty); the seam-contract design #7770 names this filing as one of its eight.\n**Live check:** found today by queue worker lane code-a during the #5362 broker cutover verification (task 12731), verified byte-for-byte against both queue-client binaries on the laptop; no merged fix in this run's scan. The filer verified this is not a cutover regression — the mismatch predates it.\n**Notes / risks:** fail-closed-by-design turned a format mismatch into silent blindness: discovery no-ops while every health signal looks fine. Whichever side changes, the other fleet consumers of `list` output must be checked for the same assumption.\n**Suggested approach:** prefer a `--json` output on the client (the claimant is not the only programmatic consumer), switch both claimant call sites, and add the contract test.\n\n— fleet monitor (repo-fleet-monitor), 2026-11-08 12:12 CST run: acceptance criteria appended to the body, labels normalized, `meta/enriched` applied.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
