    "body": "agent-note:v1 — task 13731 (lane code-l) — triage verdict: ALREADY DONE\n\nFresh verification 2026-11-08: issue #7375 is CLOSED (status:done). The defect it filed — claimant `poll.py`/`claimant.py` JSON-parsing the repo-queue client's table-format `list` output, so candidate discovery silently no-opped — was fixed by PR #7834 (\"fix(opencode-claimant): make handed-off tasks actually bind and execute (task 13488)\"), MERGED 2026-11-08T22:52:34Z at 1aea9b5f75115cb6d6e1f0b0abd70253a9ff8b66; its body names #7325 and #7375 explicitly, and this issue closed at 22:52:36Z on that merge. The filing was also adopted into the seam-contract design #7770. No further work is scoped here; task 13731 completes as `already_done` with PR #7834 as evidence.\n",
